 copywriting as a crucial service for websites we design and build. This helps the copy work properly with the strategy, UX and design, rather than being squeezed into the site at the end.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}]," Do you write blog content?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. Blog writing is available as part of our ongoing SEO support packages. We can plan and write search-led articles that answer audience questions, support topical authority and help your brand show up more often.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"Is your copywriting SEO and GEO-friendly?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. We write with humans and search visibility in mind, including search intent, keywords, metadata, internal linking, structure and readability. The aim is to create content that works for people first, while giving search engines and AI platforms a clearer understanding of the page.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"Can you write in our existing tone of voice?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yep. If you already have tone of voice guidelines, we can write within them. If your voice needs sharpening first, we can support with tone of voice strategy before moving into copywriting.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"FaqsList_faq__k2u7Q","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"children":[["$","label",null,{"className":"FaqsList_question__Dd04C","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"FaqsList_icon__Jq0d_","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 40 40","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M17.5 40V22.5H0v-5h17.5V0h5v17.5H40v5H22.5V40h-5z"}]}]}],"Do you write copy for websites you haven’t designed?",["$","input",null,{"type":"checkbox"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FaqsList_answer__xPq_g prose","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Usually, our website copywriting is tied to websites we’re designing and building, so the words, structure and creative direction work together properly from the start. For standalone content, our support is usually delivered through our ongoing SEO content package retainer.</span></p>\n"}}]}]]}]}]]]}]]}],"$L2d","$L2e"]}]]
